                        "sense_id": "2d29b34a-c6df-3639-a78b-6557dac9103d",
                        "entry_id": "5bc9a440-c1e6-3f70-9bda-81207f63e37b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A false appearance; An instance of seeming as other than what is the true form; an illusion."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "52b4feb9-2b3c-4280-964e-2f6a59cc7b98",
                                "sense_id": "2d29b34a-c6df-3639-a78b-6557dac9103d",
                                "text": "Certain priests, whom he describes as conversing very learnedly together, appeared to the children, who were at some distance, like dead horses; and many the like misappearances."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "63e78571-73bc-43ab-8162-57539c39bc2b",
                                "sense_id": "2d29b34a-c6df-3639-a78b-6557dac9103d",
                                "text": "In the standing position, wth the fixation of the leg and foot on the ground, the adduction or abduction of the leg on the pelvis is a misappearance. In reality, there is in this position an actual adduction or abduction of the pelvis on the legs, created by the pelvis tilting laterally on the legs."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cad6aeb9-bda4-4057-b87b-d4447b42baa6",
                                "sense_id": "2d29b34a-c6df-3639-a78b-6557dac9103d",
                                "text": "Keeping both American theater and its double within the sight lines, I would like to look at MPD as a pathology in which both both performativity and social performance are outstripped by a mise-en-scène that veers past the merely performative and dangerously close to theater itself, threatening to erase the differences in its very misappearance."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ff3192d7-f165-3e76-a688-6d508afe3ee8",
                        "entry_id": "5bc9a440-c1e6-3f70-9bda-81207f63e37b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Something that appears in a way that it should not."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5bdbbe10-c03c-4120-944e-6ef5c38cb8c8",
                                "sense_id": "ff3192d7-f165-3e76-a688-6d508afe3ee8",
                                "text": "We know of no set of men who are more quick to detect any misappearance than the force having charge of the condition of the yard."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
